{"seq":7,"slug":"traditional-chinese-medicine","title":"中医学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine","introMarkdown":"# 中医学\n\n真正让我对中医产生兴趣的，是一次普通的失眠。西医的体检报告上一切正常，可我还是夜夜难眠。一位老中医搭了搭脉，说我\"心脾两虚、思虑伤神\"，开了几味药，竟慢慢见效。那一刻我才意识到，原来还有另一套完全不同的看待身体的方式——它不盯着某个器官的数值，而是把人当成一个会呼吸、会失衡、又能自我调节的整体。\n\n中医学有两千多年的历史，它的源头是《黄帝内经》《伤寒杂病论》《神农本草经》这些经典。它不是靠显微镜和化验单建立起来的，而是古人在长期观察人与自然的过程中，提炼出的一整套关于健康与疾病的解释体系。阴阳、五行、藏象、经络这些词，初学时听起来玄乎，但只要换个角度理解——它们其实是古人用来描述身体运行规律的\"模型语言\"——就会发现其中藏着相当精密的逻辑。\n\n作为自学者，我不打算把这套体系当成不可质疑的教条，也不会一味把它斥为玄学。更合适的态度是：先弄懂它的语言和思路，理解每个概念在整个系统里的位置，再带着现代的眼光去审视它。这正是这个学习中心的写法——讲清楚\"中医怎么想问题\"，而不是简单背诵条文。\n\n这个学习中心分成四个部分。第一部分是基础理论，包括阴阳五行、藏象学说、气血津液，这是后面一切内容的地基。第二部分是诊断与辨证，讲望闻问切四诊和八纲、脏腑辨证，这是中医如何\"读懂\"一个病人。第三部分是中药与方剂，从单味药的性味归经，到方剂的君臣佐使配伍，再到几首经典名方。第四部分是针灸与临床，介绍经络腧穴和针刺艾灸的基本操作。\n\n值得一提的是，中医今天并不是博物馆里的标本。2019年世界卫生组织正式把以中医为代表的传统医学纳入《国际疾病分类》第十一版（ICD-11），收录了150条疾病和196条证候条目。近年来，舌诊、脉诊的客观化研究借助人工智能和图像识别不断推进，智能辅助诊疗系统已经在不少基层医疗机构试点。古老的体系正在以新的形式被重新检验和应用。\n\n学习中医，最忌讳的是死记硬背。我建议你跟着这些文档，先建立起整体框架，再去对照身边真实的例子——比如自己感冒时是怕冷还是怕热，舌苔是白还是黄。当抽象概念和具体体验对上号的那一刻，这门学科才真正向你打开了大门。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-theory","title":"中医基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/basic-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yin-yang-five-elements","title":"阴阳五行","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/basic-theory/yin-yang-five-elements"},{"seq":2,"slug":"zang-fu-organs","title":"藏象学说","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/basic-theory/zang-fu-organs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"qi-blood-fluids","title":"气血津液","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/basic-theory/qi-blood-fluids"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"diagnosis-syndrome","title":"中医诊断与辨证","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/diagnosis-syndrome","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"four-examinations","title":"四诊","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/diagnosis-syndrome/four-examinations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"eight-principles-syndrome","title":"八纲辨证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/diagnosis-syndrome/eight-principles-syndrome"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zang-fu-syndrome-differentiation","title":"脏腑辨证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/diagnosis-syndrome/zang-fu-syndrome-differentiation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"herbs-and-formulas","title":"中药与方剂","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/herbs-and-formulas","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"herb-properties-categories","title":"中药的性味归经","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/herbs-and-formulas/herb-properties-categories"},{"seq":2,"slug":"formula-composition-principles","title":"方剂的组成原则","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/herbs-and-formulas/formula-composition-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"classic-formulas","title":"经典名方","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/herbs-and-formulas/classic-formulas"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"acupuncture-and-clinical","title":"针灸与临床各科","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/acupuncture-and-clinical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meridians-and-points","title":"经络与腧穴","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/acupuncture-and-clinical/meridians-and-points"},{"seq":2,"slug":"acupuncture-techniques","title":"针刺与艾灸","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/traditional-chinese-medicine/acupuncture-and-clinical/acupuncture-techniques"}]}]}